  <div class="col-md-9 p-l-2">
            <div class="s-lg-tab-content">
                <div id="s-lg-guide-main" class="tab-pane active" >
                    <div class="row s-lg-row"><div id="s-lg-col-1" class="col-md-12"><div class="s-lg-col-boxes"><div id="s-lg-box-wrapper-28646132" class="s-lg-box-wrapper-28646132">


    <div id="s-lg-box-24411422-container" class="s-lib-box-container">
        <div id="s-lg-box-24411422" class="s-lib-box s-lib-box-std">
                            <h2 class="s-lib-box-title">
                    Accessibility &amp; Digitization Requests
                                    </h2>
                        <div id="s-lg-box-collapse-24411422" >
                <div class="s-lib-box-content">
                    

    <div class="">
        <ul id="s-lg-link-list-59163770"
            class="s-lg-link-list s-lg-link-list-2">

<li class="">
    


<div id="s-lg-content-56692705" class="">
    <span>
                    <a href="https://www.lib.umich.edu/find-borrow-request/request-digital-copies-or-duplication/accessible-copies" target="" onclick="return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: &#039;2&#039;,_st_content_id: &#039;56692705&#039;,_st_inc_return: this});" >
                Accessible Copies            </a>
        
            </span>

    
    
                <div id="s-lg-link-desc-56692705" class="s-lg-link-desc">
            If you have a qualifying disability that prevents you from reading or using print materials, we will work to get an accessible copy of any item you wish to use from the library.
        </div>
    
    </div>

</li>




<li class="">
    


<div id="s-lg-content-56692995" class="">
    <span>
                    <a href="https://www.lib.umich.edu/find-borrow-request/request-digital-copies-or-duplication/digitization-hathitrust" target="" onclick="return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: &#039;2&#039;,_st_content_id: &#039;56692995&#039;,_st_inc_return: this});" >
                Digitization for HathiTrust            </a>
        
            </span>

    
    
                <div id="s-lg-link-desc-56692995" class="s-lg-link-desc">
            Materials in the public domain from the U-M Library collections may be added to the HathiTrust Digital Library by request.
        </div>
    
    </div>

</li>

        </ul>

        
    </div>

                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div><div id="s-lg-box-wrapper-28396217" class="s-lg-box-wrapper-28396217">


    <div id="s-lg-box-24200311-container" class="s-lib-box-container">
        <div id="s-lg-box-24200311" class="s-lib-box s-lib-box-std">
                            <h2 class="s-lib-box-title">
                    Linking to or Embedding Book View 
                                    </h2>
                        <div id="s-lg-box-collapse-24200311" >
                <div class="s-lib-box-content">
                    <div id="s-lg-content-55282688" class="  clearfix">
    <p>You can link to a whole book, a page in a work, or a public collection from your web pages, social media sites, or Canvas course site. From the book reader or&nbsp;full view of a work, look at the bottom left corner for the &quot;Share&quot; option. Expanding that option will give you two&nbsp;links: copy the &quot;Permanent link to this item&quot; if you want to link to the complete work, or copy the &quot;Link to this page&quot; if you&#39;d like to point to a specific page.</p>

<p>You can also create HTML &lt;IFRAME&gt; code to embed the HathiTrust book view on a web page.</p>


    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div><div id="s-lg-box-wrapper-28396323" class="s-lg-box-wrapper-28396323">


    <div id="s-lg-box-24200412-container" class="s-lib-box-container">
        <div id="s-lg-box-24200412" class="s-lib-box s-lib-box-std">
                            <h2 class="s-lib-box-title">
                    HathiTrust Help
                                    </h2>
                        <div id="s-lg-box-collapse-24200412" >
                <div class="s-lib-box-content">
                    <div id="s-lg-content-55282823" class="  clearfix">
    <p>Some additional sources of guidance, from HathiTrust include:</p>

<ul>
	<li>How to <a href="https://www.hathitrust.org/the-collection/search-access/">search and access the digital library</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://www.hathitrust.org/the-collection/search-access/copyright-access/">Copyright access</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://www.hathitrust.org/member-libraries/services-programs/htrc/">Information related to computational access to content</a> (text mining), from the HathiTrust Research Center</li>
</ul>


    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div></div></div></div>
